<p>The waters of life flow through you, purifying any poisons or diseases currently affecting you.</p><p>For <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 7, 9, 11, 12</acronym> turns, all poisons and diseases will heal you instead of damaging you.</p><p>When activated, it also heals you for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Willpower 100">22, 29, 34, 38, 42</acronym> life for each disease or poison you have.</p><p>The healing per disease/poison will increase with your Willpower.</p>